        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions ATL03, Ornate Atlantic 3 Acrylic Door Pull with Brass Sleeve</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Atlantic Series 3 Door Pull features an acrylic handle with ornate brass brackets and a brass sleeve in the middle for a unique style perfect for traditional settings. Choose from 3 sizes: 18-1/2 inches, 20-1/2 inches, or 24-1/2 inches in a huge array of high-quality finishes for the standoffs. The acrylic itself is available in either clear or frosted. The Decorative Acrylic Door Handle with Sleeve has a 1-1/2 inch diameter so it is suitable for even the heaviest of doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Pair of <a href=\"/products/acrylic-door-handle-with-sleeve-back-to-back-pair-first-impressions-pr-atl03\"><b>Back to Back Large Acrylic Door Handles</b></a> for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Atlantic Collection Series 3 Large Decorative Acrylic Door Handle:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262247\"><b>First Impressions ATL03 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATL03018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n<li>Finial Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-ATL03020:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n<li>Finial Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-ATL03024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n<li>Finial Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Decorative Acrylic Door Handle",
                "description": "First Impressions ATL03, Decorative Acrylic Door Handle with Sleeve - The Atlantic Series 3 Door Pull features an acrylic handle with ornate brass brackets and a brass sleeve in the middle for a unique style perfect for traditional settings. Choose from 3 sizes, 18-1/2 inches, 20-1/2 inches, or 24-1/2 inches in a huge array of high-quality finishes for the standoffs. The acrylic itself is available in either clear or frosted. The Decorative Acrylic Door Handle with Sleeve has a 1-1/2 inch diameter so it is suitable for even the heaviest of doors.\r\n",
